    {
      "body": "@LucasWilkinson @MatthewBonanni gentle ping; this is the triton mla decode fix for #57017. cuda graph decode pads inactive slots with seq_len=0, stage2 then divides by e_sum=0 and writes nan, and online fp8 moe's per-tensor amax spreads that nan to every request in the batch. the fix writes zeros when e_sum==0, with a kernel regression test (3 active + 1 zero-len pad) that passes on an ada gpu. could one of you take a look and `/ci run` it?",
